            "hints": [
                "<p>Sorting a binary subsequence can only move <code>'0'</code> characters to the left and <code>'1'</code> characters to the right.</p>",
                "<p>Therefore, a binary string <code>t</code> is reachable from <code>s</code> if both strings contain the same number of <code>'1'</code> characters and, for every prefix, <code>t</code> contains no more <code>'1'</code> characters than the corresponding prefix of <code>s</code>.</p>",
                "<p>For each string in <code>strs</code>, determine how many <code>'?'</code> characters must become <code>'1'</code>. To minimize the number of ones in every prefix, assign these ones to the rightmost possible <code>'?'</code> positions.</p>",
                "<p>After this assignment, check the prefix condition against <code>s</code>.</p>"
            ],
